# Environment — .env, .env.local, and .env.*.local used to be the whole
# list, so .env.production/.env.staging/.env.backup (or any other variant)
# were committable, and nothing scans for the secret inside one. .env*
# covers every variant; the two re-includes keep committing real templates
# possible.
.env*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example

